James shared an update about a successful D&D session where Ekemon and Varkash retrieved the Titan Scale. Ekemon is level 4, has changed his weapon setup, and will team up with a new character, a Wood Elf Druid. James requested help sketching the religion and political conflict in the game, envisioning a subplot where Ekemon saves the druid from a human extremist group believing in a single "Human God." I suggested a druid religion called "The Fourfold Mother" with four elemental gods and a counter "Human Faith," characterized by its rising power and extremist factions. The conflict revolves around the druids' views on nature versus the human zealots’ dismissal of other gods. I provided concrete scenarios, character beliefs, moral hooks, and an engaging way to integrate the religion into Ekemon's quest to become a Titan.
